%%{init: {"sequence": {"noteMargin": 25, "wrapPadding": 18}}}%%
sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  participant FE as Frontend genbi thread
  participant ASK as ask route
  participant MEM as memory.ts<br/>switchable backend
  participant RT as AgentCore Runtime
  participant BR as Bedrock Converse
  FE->>ASK: question + conversationId
  ASK->>MEM: loadShortTerm
  Note over MEM: agentcore ListEvents by actorId+sessionId,<br/>selfmanaged DynamoDB last 6
  ASK->>MEM: loadLongTerm
  Note over MEM: agentcore RetrieveMemoryRecords semantic topK 3,<br/>selfmanaged S3 last 3 summaries
  MEM-->>ASK: history array + memory string
  ASK->>RT: invokeGenBiAgent with history and memory
  Note over RT: history becomes alternating user/assistant messages,<br/>memory into system prompt
  RT->>BR: Converse with history then current question
  BR-->>RT: context-aware answer
  RT-->>ASK: output
  ASK->>MEM: appendTurn
  Note over MEM: agentcore CreateEvent USER+ASSISTANT,<br/>selfmanaged PutItem TTL 24h
  ASK->>MEM: maybeSummarize
  Note over MEM: selfmanaged every 6 turns Bedrock summary to S3,<br/>agentcore no-op, semantic strategy async
